
# ^ Subject: imperative mood, <= 72 chars, then a blank line.
#
# Body: what changed and why. Wrap at 72 columns.
#
# Fill in every field below (lines starting with '#' are removed):
#   PR=          PR#<number>, e.g. PR=PR#41 (leave empty until the PR exists)
#   Test=        what was actually built/run, e.g. x86_64 build against
#                6.18 headers; arm64 RPi cross-compile; insmod/rmmod on RPi.
#                Say "Not run on hardware." if it wasn't.
#   Tested-by=   Name <email> of the person who actually tested it
#   Reviewed-by= Name <email> of the reviewer
#
# Do not add a Co-Authored-By line.
PR=
Test=
Tested-by=
Reviewed-by=
